    "long_instructions": "### Evaluate the Feature\r\n\r\n#### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Evaluate your feature using POUR:\r\n\r\n   * Can users notice what changed?\r\n   * Can users trigger it easily?\r\n   * Do users know what happened?\r\n   * Does it work reliably?\r\n\r\n2. **Identify an issue:** What is unclear, confusing, or not working well?\r\n\r\n3. **Decide what to improve:** What will you change to make this feature better?",
